# fyipedia — Unified CLI Demo
Output demo.gif

Set FontSize 20
Set Width 1000
Set Height 580
Set Shell "zsh"
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 30ms
Set Padding 24

Type "uvx --from 'fyipedia[all]' fyi version"
Enter
Sleep 2.5s

Type "uvx --from 'fyipedia[all]' fyi color info FF6B35"
Enter
Sleep 3s

Type "uvx --from 'fyipedia[all]' fyi unit convert 100 kilometer mile"
Enter
Sleep 3s

Sleep 1s
